          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "“Chief of Police” means the Chief of Police of Topeka, Kansas, or his or her designee.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "c2ebbb59-450a-5c64-b96c-0b022ceae935",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 228,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:1",
          "start": 87
        },
        "quote": "“Conviction” shall mean a finding of guilty of the commission of a criminal offense as specified herein, but shall not include the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "656d2080-6744-5174-bc7e-bc32284acfc7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 300,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:2",
          "start": 229
        },
        "quote": "(1) A charge for which a person has successfully completed a diversion;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "1cb2ff3f-7719-5a99-9248-d4d8db15d8bf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 390,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:3",
          "start": 301
        },
        "quote": "(2) A charge that resulted in a deferred judgment for a juvenile under the age of 18; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "cc38a09b-95b3-51e0-a323-d4a574bc0903",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 494,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:4",
          "start": 391
        },
        "quote": "(3) A conviction that has been expunged or pardoned pursuant to the law of any applicable jurisdiction.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "882e95d7-85ca-53e1-8f85-7396dfd2bf1e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 521,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:5",
          "start": 495
        },
        "quote": "“Crime of violence” means:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "d5d48125-1c5b-5d90-b0c4-408e5fef5955",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 665,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:6",
          "start": 522
        },
        "quote": "(1) An offense that has as an element the use, attempted use, or threatened use of physical force against the person or property of another; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "b2bbc47d-d5ef-58a4-aef8-9f8433f8f5eb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 887,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:7",
          "start": 666
        },
        "quote": "(2) Any other offense that is a felony or misdemeanor and that, by its nature, involves a substantial risk that physical force against the person or property of another may be used in the course of committing the offense.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "86018533-7d98-55aa-b920-e987e471eaa4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1239,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:8",
          "start": 888
        },
        "quote": "“Employee, agent, and guard” means all persons employed by a private security firm in the conduct of business, except employees whose duties are confined entirely to stenographic, clerical or management duties in the business office of the private security firm or other employees not directly engaged in providing protection and preserving the peace.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "fc053f16-f2c1-5f00-8c95-774e30eeca3e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1400,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:9",
          "start": 1240
        },
        "quote": "“License” means the license to act as a private security firm or to act as an employee, agent or guard of a private security firm issued by the Chief of Police.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "b4a54e0e-2d68-562e-ab95-577fc1bdbb5a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1465,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:10",
          "start": 1401
        },
        "quote": "“Police Department” means the Topeka, Kansas, Police Department.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "612f52d1-5935-5583-969d-439f0d3228ba",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1591,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:11",
          "start": 1466
        },
        "quote": "“Private detective” means any person who engages in detective business as defined by K.S.A. 75-7b01 , and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "05490ccb-e639-5b44-ac99-a3d93b6b01be",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1767,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:12",
          "start": 1592
        },
        "quote": "“Private security firm” means any person or company that conducts or is engaged in the business of providing protection and preserving the peace of one or more establishments.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "394c8992-f366-511c-ae97-d076391568f6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1882,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:13",
          "start": 1768
        },
        "quote": "“State agency” means any department, agency or instrumentality of the State of Kansas. (Ord. 20463 § 1, 11-21-23.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.90.010 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "7ca32992-f539-53b6-bbf1-deb1387095c3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1938,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:14",
          "start": 1883
